# Auto Save: GitHub + Vercel

After completing meaningful code changes in a session:

1. **Commit** with a clear message (`sousa.2003pedro@gmail.com` as author)
2. **Push** to `origin main` on `PedroSousa008/World-Cup-Fantasy-Draft`
3. **Deploy** with `vercel deploy --prod --yes --scope pedro-sousas-projects-1cde54a0`

Use `scripts/sync.sh "commit message"` when possible. Never store GitHub tokens in repo files.

If push or deploy fails, stop and tell the user once — do not hang on interactive auth.

GitHub repo: https://github.com/PedroSousa008/World-Cup-Fantasy-Draft
